{"id":"6b0c62510422f352","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-extensional-implication.md","title":"df-predicate-extensionality","display":"df-predicate-extensionality","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-extensional-implication","aliases":["16-df-extensional-implication","Predicate extensionality"],"display":"df-predicate-extensionality","depends_on":["[[16-df-dep-pred-11]]"],"source":"Section 0.2, pp. 11–13 (PDF 31–33); dependent-set specialization of Section 11.1","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-extensional-implication"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-extensional-implication</span><span>Predicate extensionality</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-predicate-extensionality"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dfbbd3e4e75d12c7\" href=\"?note=dfbbd3e4e75d12c7\" title=\"16-df-dep-pred-11\">16-df-dep-pred-11</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Section 0.2, pp. 11–13 (PDF 31–33); dependent-set specialization of Section 11.1"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>本页限于集合模型：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:\\Gamma\\to\\mathcal U\">\\(\\sigma:\\Gamma\\to\\mathcal U\\)</span> 为小集合族；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma.\\sigma\">\\(\\Gamma.\\sigma\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{DepPred}(\\Gamma,\\sigma)=\\mathcal P(\\Gamma.\\sigma)\">\\(\\mathsf{DepPred}(\\Gamma,\\sigma)=\\mathcal P(\\Gamma.\\sigma)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dfbbd3e4e75d12c7\" href=\"?note=dfbbd3e4e75d12c7\" title=\"16-df-dep-pred-11\">16-df-dep-pred-11</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,Q\\in\\mathsf{DepPred}(\\Gamma,\\sigma)\">\\(P,Q\\in\\mathsf{DepPred}(\\Gamma,\\sigma)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PredExt}_{\\Gamma,\\sigma}(P,Q)\">\\(\\mathrm{PredExt}_{\\Gamma,\\sigma}(P,Q)\\)</span> 在下文定义，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,\\sigma\">\\(\\Gamma,\\sigma\\)</span> 时简写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PredExt}(P,Q)\">\\(\\mathrm{PredExt}(P,Q)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>固定 Grothendieck 宇宙 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>；实例化所引集合依赖类型定义时，其环境宇宙取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span>、码集取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{\\mathcal U}(\\Gamma)=\\mathcal U^\\Gamma\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{\\mathcal U}(\\Gamma)=\\mathcal U^\\Gamma\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PredExt}_{\\Gamma,\\sigma}(P,Q)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\left[\\bigl((\\forall z\\in\\Gamma.\\sigma)\\ (z\\in P\\Longleftrightarrow z\\in Q)\\bigr)\\Longrightarrow P=Q\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PredExt}_{\\Gamma,\\sigma}(P,Q)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\left[\\bigl((\\forall z\\in\\Gamma.\\sigma)\\ (z\\in P\\Longleftrightarrow z\\in Q)\\bigr)\\Longrightarrow P=Q\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PredExt}_{\\Gamma,\\sigma}(P,Q).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PredExt}_{\\Gamma,\\sigma}(P,Q).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,Q\">\\(P,Q\\)</span> 是同一总空间的子集，故逐点成员等价由集合外延公理给出相等。第二式为这一集合模型中的证明结论；本页不把一般预序纤维的双向蕴涵误说成对象记录相等。</li>\n<li>来源背景：Jacobs, §0.2 的子集语义，pp. 11–13（PDF 31–33）；依赖谓词的集合实例见本书 §11.1。本页的外延结论是宿主集合论推导。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-dep-pred-11","status":"resolved","id":"dfbbd3e4e75d12c7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-dep-pred-11]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-dep-pred-11","status":"resolved","id":"dfbbd3e4e75d12c7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本页限于集合模型：$\\Gamma$ 为集合，$\\sigma:\\Gamma\\to\\mathcal U$ 为小集合族；$\\Gamma.\\sigma$、$\\mathsf{DepPred}(\\Gamma,\\sigma)=\\mathcal P(\\Gamma.\\sigma)$ 采用 [[16-df-dep-pred-11]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma:\\Gamma\\to\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma.\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{DepPred}(\\Gamma,\\sigma)=\\mathcal P(\\Gamma.\\sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"P,Q\\in\\mathsf{DepPred}(\\Gamma,\\sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PredExt}_{\\Gamma,\\sigma}(P,Q)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma,\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PredExt}(P,Q)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{\\mathcal U}(\\Gamma)=\\mathcal U^\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PredExt}_{\\Gamma,\\sigma}(P,Q)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\left[\\bigl((\\forall z\\in\\Gamma.\\sigma)\\ (z\\in P\\Longleftrightarrow z\\in Q)\\bigr)\\Longrightarrow P=Q\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PredExt}_{\\Gamma,\\sigma}(P,Q).","display":true},{"tex":"P,Q","display":false}],"bytes":1733,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-212","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-extensional-implication|df-predicate-extensionality]]"}],"outgoing":["dfbbd3e4e75d12c7"]}